    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property is delighted to present this excellent opportunity to acquire a well-positioned one-bedroom ground floor apartment in the highly sought-after Clós Bríd development in Saltown, Dundalk.\r\n\r\nThis bright and practical apartment offers comfortable accommodation with the convenience of ground-floor living, making it an ideal choice for a first-time buyer, downsizer, or investor.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises an entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and kitchen area, a well-proportioned bedroom, and a bathroom. The accommodation provides a comfortable and low-maintenance home in a convenient residential setting, it also benefits from its own private garden. \r\n\r\nClós Bríd is situated within easy reach of Dundalk town centre, with a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and amenities nearby. The location also provides good access to local transport links and the M1 motorway, making it convenient for commuters.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nHallway : 3.19m x 2.36m \r\nKitchen/Living Room : 6.01m x 3.39m \r\nBedroom : 4.06m x 2.93m \r\nBathroom : 2.22m x 1.77m \r\n\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
